OL,3,GNEWSAMinister pledges facial
OL,4,Arecognition law 'safeguards'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe policing minister has promised new
OL,7,Flegislation on the use of live facial
OL,8,Frecognition (LFR) in public areas that
OL,9,Fshe says will introduce stronger
OL,10,Fsafeguards to ensure it is used in a
OL,11,Fproportionate way.
OL,13,FSarah Jones said a government
OL,14,Fconsultation suggested the public "by
OL,15,Fand large" supported LFR, but wanted
OL,16,Freassurances around how it is used.
OL,18,FThe Metropolitan Police said LFR was
OL,19,F"making London safer" and had led to
OL,20,Fmore than 3,000 arrests in the past two
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
