OL,3,GNEWSAMinister pledges facial
OL,4,Arecognition law 'safeguards'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, privacy campaign group Big
OL,7,FBrother Watch said the technology "is
OL,8,Ftreating everyone who walks by as a
OL,9,Fsuspect by default - you have to prove
OL,10,Fthat you're not someone that the police
OL,11,Fis looking for".
